# Migration safety

Engage uses Flyway only (no `dev-import.sql` yet). Migration `V0.0.1` seeds one channel.

When changing schema:

1. Update entity fields and repositories in the same PR.
2. Update sync tasks if new `NOT NULL` columns need YouTube mapping.
3. Restart `quarkus:dev` and confirm Flyway applies cleanly.

If `dev-import.sql` is added later, treat it like [passport dev-import rules](../../passport/.cursor/rules/dev-import-sql-safety.mdc) — same PR as migration.
